		<Replace Tag="LOC_ESG_MOD_TITLE" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Era Score Guide</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ESG_MOD_TEASER" Language="en_US">
			<Text>See how to earn Era Score right in the Era panel.</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_ESG_MOD_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Adds a "How to earn Era Score" section to the Era Progress panel (bottom right). Lists every historic moment that gives Era Score, how much it gives, which ones you can still earn this era, which ones you already earned, and which world firsts were already taken by others. Also lists this era's dedications. UI only: safe to add to or remove from existing saves.</Text>
		</Replace>

